# The Akroan War over three of Bot1's turns. T3, I: Bot1 takes Bot2's Memnite for as long as the Saga stays (CR 611.2b).
# T5, II: until Bot1's next turn the creatures Bot1's opponent controls attack if able (CR 508.1d, 611.2c) - Bot2's Raging
# Goblin may not stay home on T6, but Bot1's own Elves and the Memnite Bot1 now controls (read as it is now, not as it
# entered) may on T5. T7, III: each tapped creature of either player deals damage to itself equal to its power - Bot2's
# Goblin (tapped from attacking) and Bot1's Elves (tapped for mana with III on the stack) die, the untapped Memnite does
# not - then the Saga is sacrificed and Bot2 has Memnite back (CR 714.4, 611.2b). T8: the effect is over, Memnite
# may stay home.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Llanowar Elves
The Akroan War
Mountain
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Raging Goblin
Memnite
Island x17

